# Packages the scoped pre-push gate must run on EVERY push (bead ci-4w2t).
#
# scripts/push-gate-select narrows a push to the packages its changed files
# can reach through the Go import and embed graph. These packages are not
# reachable that way: their tests resolve the repository root and read source
# they do not import -- the resource census over every tracked *.go file, the
# git-tracked-source guards, the walkers that assert a property of the whole
# tree. A change to a leaf package can break any of them while sharing no
# import edge with them, so the closure alone would silently drop them.
#
# MEMBERSHIP IS MECHANICAL, NOT CURATED. Every package with a Go file
# mentioning a repository-root marker -- `repoRoot`-style helper names,
# `git ls-files`, `rev-parse --show-toplevel` -- must appear here, and
# scripts/test-push-gate-select.sh fails the build when one does not. That
# check is the guarantee; this list is only its current answer. Do NOT prune an
# entry because it looks like it only reads a fixture repo: the marker is
# deliberately over-broad, because a package listed here costs wall clock
# while a package missing from here costs a green build that tested nothing.
#
# The scan covers every tracked *.go file, NOT only *_test.go, and that is
# load-bearing rather than lazy. internal/testpolicy/resourcecensus walks
# every tracked source file from census.go, a non-test file its _test.go
# merely calls -- a test-files-only scan drops the single most repo-wide
# package in the tree.
#
# Entries that are integration-tagged (test/...) compile to no tests under
# the untagged fast suite and cost ~nothing; they are listed anyway so no
# build-tag judgment enters the rule.
#
# Regenerate the current answer with:
#   git ls-files -z -- '*.go' | xargs -0 grep -lEi 'repo_?root|ls-files|show-toplevel' \
#     | xargs -n1 dirname | sort -u | sed 's|^|./|'

./cmd/gc
./examples/bd/dolt
./examples/gastown
./internal/agentutil
./internal/api
./internal/api/genclient
./internal/beadmeta
./internal/beads
./internal/beads/contract
./internal/bootstrap
./internal/builtinpacks
./internal/config
./internal/formula
./internal/importsvc
./internal/molecule
./internal/pgauth
./internal/session
./internal/testenv
./internal/testpolicy/resourcecensus
./internal/testutil/providerledger
./internal/worker/workertest
./scripts
./test/docsync
./test/integration
./test/packlint
./test/qualification
./test/workflows
